                     Bacillus halodurans (806 aa); etc. Also highly similar to
                     Z46257|MLACEA_7 aceA gene for isocitrate L from
                     Mycobacterium leprae (750 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 3615,
                     E():0, (76.5% identity in 752 aa overlap). And similar to
