                     from Saccharomyces cerevisiae (843 aa), FASTA scores: opt:
                     777, E(): 0, (30.4% identity in 605 aa overlap);
                     P49135|XPB_MOUSE DNA-REPAIR PROTEIN COMPLEMENTING XP-B
                     CELLS from Mus musculus (Mouse) (783 aa), FASTA scores:
