                     avium subsp. paratuberculosis (527 aa). Also highly
                     similar to others e.g. CAB92677.1|AL356832 bifunctional
                     purine biosynthesis protein from Streptomyces coelicolor
                     (523 aa); NP_388534.1|NC_000964
