                     protein cy02b10.25c (396 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 2124,
                     E(): 0, (85.1% identity in 397 aa overlap). Note that
                     expression of Rv1196 was demonstrated in lysates by
                     immunodetection (see first citation below).
