                     codon) to P96363|Rv1038c|MTCY10G2.11 PUTATIVE ESAT-6 LIKE
                     PROTEIN 2 (98 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 389, E(): 5.8e-26,
                     (100.0% identity in 58 aa overlap). Also identical to
