                     DEHYDROGENASE, DECARBOXYLATING from Mycobacterium
                     tuberculosis (340 aa), FASTA score: (33.0% identity in 351
                     aa overlap). Note that Rv1844c is most similar to gnd's
                     from Gram negative organisms, while
