                     /note="Mb2040, -, len: 346 aa. Equivalent to Rv2017, len:
                     346 aa, from Mycobacterium tuberculosis strain H37Rv,
                     (99.7% identity in 346 aa overlap). Hypothetical
                     regulatory protein, shows similarity at N-terminal end to
