                     subdomain signature 2. Protein product from Mb2529c
                     detected using shotgun mass spectrometry and SWATH mass
                     spectrometry. Mb2529c found to be expressed during
                     exponential growth in Sauton's minimal media by
                     RNA-sequencing."
