                     a single gene. In Mycobacterium bovis, a frameshift due to
                     a single base transition (g-a) splits Rv2577 into 2 parts,
                     Mb2607 and Mb2608. Mb2607 found to be expressed during
                     exponential growth in Sauton's minimal media by
                     RNA-sequencing."
