                     tuberculosis (225 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 149, E(): 0.025,
                     (28.95% identity in 197 aa overlap). Contains
                     helix-turn-helix motif at aa 31-52 (Score 1662, +4.85 SD).
                     REMARK-M.bovis-M.tuberculosis: In Mycobacterium bovis, a 3
                     bp deletion (ggg-*) leads to a slightly shorter product
                     compared to its homolog in Mycobacterium tuberculosis
                     strain H37Rv (223 aa versus 224 aa). Mb2654c found to be
                     expressed during exponential growth in Sauton's minimal
                     media by RNA-sequencing."
