                     cress) (244 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 491, E(): 7.3e-25,
                     (42.1% identity in 190 aa overlap); Q98LI4|MLL1009 from
                     Rhizobium loti (Mesorhizobium loti) (258 aa), FASTA
