                     /note="Mb2968, -, len: 413 aa. Equivalent to Rv2943, len:
                     413 aa, from Mycobacterium tuberculosis strain H37Rv,
                     (100.0% identity in 413 aa overlap). Probable transposase
                     for insertion sequence IS1533, similar to other
                     transposases e.g. P15025|ISTA_ECOLI ista protein
                     (insertion sequence IS21) from Escherichia coli (390 aa),
                     FASTA scores: opt: 268, E(): 5.1e-11, (24.1% identity in
                     378 aa overlap). Contains potential helix-turn-helix motif
                     at aa 19-40 (Score 1611, +4.67 SD). Mb2968 found to be
                     expressed during exponential growth in Sauton's minimal
                     media by RNA-sequencing."
