                     from Streptomyces coelicolor (276 aa), FASTA scores: opt:
                     849, E(): 1.2e-49, (51.7% identity in 267 aa overlap);
                     Q9ZBW7|SC4B5.01C PUTATIVE OXIDOREDUCTASE from Streptomyces
