                     start at GTG at 16801 in Y22D7 but no RBS obvious so
                     TBparse-predicted start at 16881 taken. BELONGS TO THE
                     CSTA FAMILY. Mb3090 found to be expressed during
                     exponential growth in Sauton's minimal media by
                     RNA-sequencing."
