                     from Prauserella rugosa (212 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 246,
                     E(): 4.4e-09, (27.95% identity in 186 aa overlap);
                     Q9K4B0|SC7E4.06 PUTATIVE TETR-FAMILY TRANSCRIPTIONAL from
