                     E(): 1.5e-43, (81.55% identity in 168 aa overlap). Also
                     similar to others e.g. Q9AXD0|AIRC from Nicotiana tabacum
                     (Common tobacco) (623 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 712, E():
                     1.4e-33, (69.35% identity in 160 aa overlap) (similarity
