                     enzyme. Previously known as aldB. Protein product from
                     Mb3321 detected using shotgun mass spectrometry and SWATH
                     mass spectrometry. Mb3321 found to be expressed during
                     exponential growth in Sauton's minimal media by
                     RNA-sequencing."
