                     stain K12 (1538 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 2930, E():
                     1.5e-159, (47.55% identity in 1569 aa overlap);
                     AAG56642|LHR from Escherichia coli stain O157:H7 EDL933
                     (1538 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 2930, E(): 1.5e-159, (47.6%
                     identity in 1561 aa overlap); O86821|SC7C7.16c from
