                     Q9HYW9|PA3272 from Pseudomonas aeruginosa (1448 aa), FASTA
                     scores: opt: 907, E(): 6.2e-44, (35.85% identity in 1512
                     aa overlap); etc. SIMILAR TO DEAD/DEAH BOX HELICASE FAMILY
                     AND TO HELICASE C-TERMINAL DOMAIN. Contains PS00017
