                     (similarity at C-terminus for this one); and
                     Q49914|L308_F1_17 (166 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 900, E():
                     1.7e-45, (79.0% identity in 162 aa overlap) (similarity at
                     N-terminus for this one); Q49923|U0308N (86 aa) FASTA
                     scores: opt: 149, E(): 0.052, (48.35% identity in 60 aa
                     overlap); etc. Note that the Rv3311 corresponding protein
                     in Mycobacterium leprae is similar to products of two
                     adjacent ORFs. Also some similarity to Q9XI61|F9L1.1
                     HYPOTHETICAL PROTEIN from Arabidopsis thaliana (Mouse-ear
                     cress) (523 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 134, E(): 1.8, (25.1%
                     identity in 203 aa overlap). Equivalent to AAK47753 from
                     Mycobacterium tuberculosis strain CDC1551 (431 aa) but
                     shorter 12 aa. Protein product from Mb3339 detected using
                     shotgun mass spectrometry and SWATH mass spectrometry.
                     Mb3339 found to be expressed during exponential growth in
                     Sauton's minimal media by RNA-sequencing."
