                     41 aa, to P71824|Rv0769|MTCY369.14 PUTATIVE SHORT-CHAIN
                     TYPE DEHYDROGENASE/REDUCTASE CY369.14 from Mycobacterium
                     tuberculosis (248 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 462, E():
