                     overlap). COULD BELONG TO THE ENOYL-COA
                     HYDRATASE/ISOMERASE FAMILY. Protein product from Mb3545
                     detected using shotgun mass spectrometry and SWATH mass
                     spectrometry. Mb3545 found to be expressed during
                     exponential growth in Sauton's minimal media by
                     RNA-sequencing."
