                     Rhizobium loti (Mesorhizobium loti) (278 aa), FASTA
                     scores: opt: 697, E(): 1.1e-38, (44.1% identity in 272 aa
                     overlap); P77567|NHOA_ECOLI|B1463 from Escherichia coli
                     strain K12 (281 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 537, E(): 4.4e-28,
