                     loti) (236 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 304, E(): 5e-11,
                     (27.05% identity in 244 aa overlap); etc. Has suitable
                     signal peptide and prokaryotic membrane lipoprotein lipid
                     attachment site (PS00013). REMARK-M.bovis-M.tuberculosis:
                     In Mycobacterium bovis, a large 5894 bp deletion leads to
