                     /note="Mb3652, ppa, len: 162 aa. Equivalent to Rv3628,
                     len: 162 aa, from Mycobacterium tuberculosis strain H37Rv,
                     (100.0% identity in 162 aa overlap). ppa, inorganic
                     pyrophosphatase (EC 3.6.1.1) (see first citation),
                     identical to O69540|IPYR_MYCLEPPA|ML0210|MLCB2548.21
                     INORGANIC PYROPHOSPHATASE from Mycobacterium leprae (162
                     aa) FASTA scores: opt: 1018, E(): 1.3e-59, (89.5% identity
                     in 162 aa overlap). Also highly similar to many bacterial
                     pyrophosphatases e.g. Q9X8I9|IPYR_STRCO|PPA|SCE9.16 from
                     Streptomyces coelicolor (163 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 773,
                     E(): 1.3e-43, (67.5% identity in 163 aa overlap);
                     O05545|IPYR_GLUOX|PPA from Gluconobacter oxydans
                     (Gluconobacter suboxydans) (176 aa), FASTA scores: opt:
                     553, E(): 3.2e-29, (53.8% identity in 145 aa overlap);
                     P77992|IPYR_THELI|PPA from Thermococcus litoralis (176 aa)
