                     (58.0% identity in 536 aa overlap); etc. Equivalent to
                     AAK48181 from Mycobacterium tuberculosis strain CDC1551
                     (659 aa) but shorter 15 aa. Contains PS00815 and PS00816
                     Alpha-isopropylmalate and homocitrate synthases signatures
                     1 and 2. BELONGS TO THE ALPHA-IPM SYNTHETASE / HOMOCITRATE
                     SYNTHASE FAMILY. REMARK-M.bovis-M.tuberculosis: In
