                     Q9CDC0|ML0087 PUTATIVE ACYLTRANSFERASE from Mycobacterium
                     leprae (257 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 845, E(): 2.7e-47,
                     (53.25% identity in 246 aa overlap). Also highly similar
                     to Q9K3R3|2SCG4.01 PUTATIVE ACYLTRANSFERASE from
                     Streptomyces coelicolor (242 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 656,
                     E(): 3.7e-35, (47.85% identity in 234 aa overlap); and
                     similar to many putative acyltransferases and hypothetical
                     proteins e.g. P74498|SLL1848 HYPOTHETICAL 24.3 KDA PROTEIN
                     from Synechocystis sp. strain PCC 6803 (225 aa) FASTA
                     scores: opt: 275, E(): 1.2e-10, (34.8% identity in 181 aa
