                     /locus_tag="BQ2027_MB3917C"
                     /note="Mb3917c, -, len: 289 aa. Equivalent to 3' end of
                     Rv3887c, len: 509 aa, from Mycobacterium tuberculosis
                     strain H37Rv, (99.7% identity in 288 aa overlap). Probable
                     conserved transmembrane protein (has hydrophilic stretch
                     from ~1-130 then very hydrophobic domain), similar to
                     other membrane proteins and with weak similarity to known
                     transporters, e.g. Q9CBV2|ML1539 PROBABLE MEMBRANE PROTEIN
                     from Mycobacterium leprae (503 aa), FASTA scores: opt:
                     395, E(): 2.3e-16, (28.0% identity in 496 aa overlap);
                     Q9CD35|ML2529 CONSERVED MEMBRANE PROTEIN from
                     Mycobacterium leprae (485 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 221,
                     E(): 6.6e-06, (24.6% identity in 423 aa overlap);
                     Q9ADP8|2SC10A7.11 PUTATIVE INTEGRAL MEMBRANE PROTEIN from
                     Streptomyces coelicolor (430 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 171,
                     E(): 0.0062, (26.55% identity in 358 aa overlap);
                     CAC44275|SCBAC17F8.03 PUTATIVE DRUG EFFLUX PROTEIN from
                     Streptomyces coelicolor (416 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 160,
                     E(): 0.028, (27.85% identity in 323 aa overlap); etc. Also
                     similar to others from Mycobacterium tuberculosis e.g.
                     O53944|Rv1795|MTV049.17 PUTATIVE MEMBRANE PROTEIN (503
                     aa), FASTA scores: opt: 360, E(): 2.9e-14, (26.65%
                     identity in 514 aa overlap); etc. Equivalent to AAK48369
                     from Mycobacterium tuberculosis strain CDC1551 (469 aa)
                     but longer 40 aa. REMARK-M.bovis-M.tuberculosis: In
