                     aa overlap). Also highly similar to many e.g.
                     Q9X8T2|SCH24.18 PUTATIVE RNA NUCLEOTIDYLTRANSFERASE from
                     Streptomyces coelicolor (483 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 1856,
                     E(): 3.7e-107, (61.55% identity in 455 aa overlap); Q9ZN65
                     POLYA POLYMERASE from Prevotella ruminicola (Bacteroides
                     ruminicola) (479 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 830, E():
                     8.5e-44, (34.85% identity in 445 aa overlap);
                     P42977|PAPS_BACSU POLY(A) POLYMERASE from Bacillus
                     subtilis (397 aa), FASTA scores: opt: 479, E(): 3.5e-22,
                     (29.35% identity in 450 aa overlap); etc. Contains:
                     PS00017 ATP/GTP-binding site motif A (P-loop), PS00018
